  "prefLabel": "Per-A 205.01 Right to a Public Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 205.01 Right to a Public Hearing. Parties to an appeal shall have the right to be heard publicly in accordance with these rules and the procedures provided for in RSA 541-A:31-36 and RSA 91-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 200) #7378, eff 10-23-00; ss by #9205, eff 10-23-08",
